【Note】
================================================================================
Prompt: plan_outline_batch.j2
Service Step: PLAN_OUTLINE_BATCH (Outline Batch Generation)
Function: Generate chapter outlines for a specified range (batch_start-batch_end)
         based on the Narrative Blueprint, containing structured information
         such as goal, beats_summary, main_plot_points, element_focus.
Upstream Inputs:
  - spec: User-provided story specifications (genre, theme, tone, length_target, etc.)
  - blueprint: From PLAN_OUTLINE (synopsis, narrative_phases, key_turning_points,
               character_arcs, subplot_plan, ending_strategy, etc.)
  - blueprint.element_selection: From BLUEPRINT_ELEMENT_SELECT (extension_elements candidates)
  - style_profile: From PROFILE_STYLE (hook_config, cool_point_config, etc.)
  - batch_start/batch_end: Chapter range for this batch
  - words_per_chapter: Target word count per chapter
  - previous_chapters: Already generated chapters (for continuity)
  - outline_tracker_context: Unified memory tracking (relationship dynamics, theme appearances, key events, etc.)
  - outline_entity_catalog: Registered IDs and entity types for every chapter, including unlocked previews.
  - chapter_design_matrix: Canonical entity_id/cast constraints and blueprint emotional evidence for this batch
Downstream Output:
  - JSON: {chapters: [{chapter_number, title, goal, beats_summary, main_plot_points,
             subplot_points, element_focus, pov_character_id, pov_character_name,
             involved_character_ids, cast_plan, emotional_plan, scene_design_goals,
             setting, expected_word_count, expected_hook, expected_payoffs, notes}]}
  - Downstream Consumer: PLAN_CHAPTER (Chapter Planning)
Consumption Chain Priority:
  P0 = blueprint.narrative_phases / key_turning_points (Phase coverage cannot be skipped/crossed)
  P1 = element_focus selection constraints
  P2 = style_profile read-through suggestions
Brief Example:
  Input: batch_start=1, batch_end=5, blueprint={synopsis:"...", phases:[...]}
  Output: {chapters:[{chapter_number:1, title:"City Gate Confrontation", goal:"...", beats_summary:[...]}]}
================================================================================
#}

