Please generate chapter outlines for chapters {{ batch_start }} to {{ batch_end }} based on the following story specifications and narrative blueprint.

## Story Specifications
- Genre: {{ spec.genre }} | Theme: {{ spec.theme }} | Tone: {{ spec.tone }}
- Target Word Count: {{ spec.length_target }} | Language: {{ describe_language(spec.language) }}
{% if spec.characters_hint %}- Characters: {{ spec.characters_hint }}{% endif %}
{% if spec.world_hint %}- Worldview: {{ spec.world_hint }}{% endif %}
{% if spec.conflict_hint %}- Core Conflict: {{ spec.conflict_hint }}{% endif %}
{% if spec.pov_hint %}- Narrative POV: {{ spec.pov_hint }}{% endif %}
{% if spec.opening_style %}- Opening Style Sample (for technique reference only, do not copy verbatim to Chapter 1): {{ spec.opening_style }}{% endif %}
{% if spec.ending_style %}- Ending Style Sample (for technique reference only, do not copy verbatim to final chapter): {{ spec.ending_style }}{% endif %}

